            "output": "PMapper analysis - account 111122223333 (8 principals, 11 edges)\n\n[HIGH] user/dev-lead can reach admin\n       via: iam:CreatePolicyVersion + iam:SetDefaultPolicyVersion on policy/DevToolingPolicy (attached to itself)\n[HIGH] role/OnboardingBotRole can reach admin\n       via: iam:AttachUserPolicy on user/* (any managed policy, any user)\n[HIGH] role/OpsEngineerRole can reach admin\n       via: iam:UpdateAssumeRolePolicy on role/* (can change who may assume role/PlatformAdminRole)\n[HIGH] user/ci-deployer can reach admin\n       via: iam:PassRole on * + lambda:CreateFunction (role/PlatformAdminRole can be passed to Lambda)\n[INFO] role/ReportingRole: no path to admin (iam:PassRole limited to role/report-render-exec for lambda.amazonaws.com)\n\nSummary: 4 principals with a path to admin, 1 clean."
