        "help": "Commands you can try (like the AWS CLI):\n  aws sts get-caller-identity\n  aws ec2 describe-instances\n  aws ec2 modify-instance-metadata-options --instance-id <id> --http-tokens required --http-put-response-hop-limit 1\n  aws cloudwatch get-metric-statistics --namespace AWS/EC2 --metric-name MetadataNoToken --dimensions Name=InstanceId,Value=<id> --statistics Sum --period 3600 --start-time 2026-11-19T00:00:00Z --end-time 2026-11-20T00:00:00Z\n  aws configservice get-compliance-details-by-config-rule --config-rule-name imds-hardening-check",
